{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrierVacuity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrierVacuity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Complex.Exponential","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Determinant.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.circularWitness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.circularWitness","kind":"instance","line":246,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L246-L252","doc":"**The circularity, stated.**  `TransferMatrixSpectrum` is satisfiable for\nevery `q` — by a matrix built from the eigenphase itself.  So satisfying it is\nnot evidence about the substrate; the content is entirely in *which* `M`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.rotationOfPhase_det","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.rotationOfPhase_det","kind":"theorem","line":242,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L242-L244","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.rotationOfPhase_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.rotationOfPhase_trace","kind":"theorem","line":238,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L238-L240","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.rotationOfPhase","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.rotationOfPhase","kind":"def","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L234-L236","doc":"The rotation `exp(αJ)`, `J² = −I`, written out. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.replacement_excludes_some_matrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.replacement_excludes_some_matrix","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L149-L158","doc":"Concrete non-vacuity witness: a matrix violating the trace condition admits\nno instance.  Since `2 cos α ≤ 2 < 3`, the matrix `!![3, 0; 0, 0]` (trace `3`)\nis excluded for every `q` — so the class is not satisfied by everything. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum.det_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum.det_eq","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L147-L147","doc":"Unimodular spectrum: `e^{+iα}·e^{−iα} = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum.trace_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum.trace_eq","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L145-L145","doc":"The Markov-symmetrised single-wrap character is `2 cos α`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum.mk","kind":"ctor","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L143-L143","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixSpectrum","kind":"class","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L136-L147","doc":"**Spectral identification of the β-decay transfer matrix** (content-bearing).\n\n`M` is the transfer matrix restricted to the 2-d irrep `V_(2,1)` of `H₃(q)`.\nThe two fields pin its spectrum to `{e^{+iα}, e^{−iα}}` with `α = eigenphase q`.\n\nDeliberately **uninstantiated**: this is the open input tranche S1 must supply,\nand it is the statement a derivation of `α` would have to discharge. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.carrier_is_trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.carrier_is_trivial","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L119-L122","doc":"**The carrier is equivalent to `True`.**  Hence `[TransferMatrixEigenphase q] → P`\ncarries exactly the content of `P`; the hypothesis discharges itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.vacuousWitness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.vacuousWitness","kind":"instance","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L113-L117","doc":"**The carrier is inhabited for every `q`**, by a proof using nothing about\n`eigenphase`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.field2_holds_for_any_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.field2_holds_for_any_real","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L110-L111","doc":"Field 2 likewise: `cos` is even, for every real. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.field1_holds_for_any_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.field1_holds_for_any_real","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L103-L108","doc":"Field 1 holds for an **arbitrary** real, so it says nothing about the\neigenphase. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase.cos_eigenphase_bar_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase.cos_eigenphase_bar_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L100-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase.symmetrized_character_in_unit_disc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase.symmetrized_character_in_unit_disc","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L98-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase.mk","kind":"ctor","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L97-L97","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.TransferMatrixEigenphase","kind":"class","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L96-L101","doc":"The existing carrier, fields reproduced verbatim. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.eigenphase","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.eigenphase","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L93-L94","doc":"The asserted single-wrap eigenphase `α = (z−1)h/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.heckeH","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.heckeH","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L90-L91","doc":"`h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.markovZC","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.EigenphaseCarrier.markovZC","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/EigenphaseCarrierVacuity.lean#L87-L88","doc":"Convention-C Markov parameter, as spelled in the content block. ","signatureChunk":0}]}